@martin_casado have you looked at @activegraphai? also built as a runtime for self building agents.

very similar to Exo, but the immutable log projects a graph like state of the agent that behaviors subscribe to (à la blackboard/kafka). this allows for very natural propose-and-accept type rules for strict self modification loops.

example paper where I used it to self improve on longmemeval score: https://t.co/gMouW0sTCS

